    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：李享、张参将、巴赫、车厘子</span></p><p><span>简介：</span></p><p><span>你是否收到过奇怪的包裹？上面写了你的名字，但你却不记得自己买过任何东西，你不认识寄件人，不熟悉寄件人的地址，甚至打开包裹后，里面的东西也让你觉得一头雾水。当你决定调查真相的时候，你又觉得无从下手。没错，看到这个开头，各位就知道我们超级无敌互动推理播客又来了。这次依然是录得开心，听得有趣。如果你也想参与到这场推理游戏当中，那就跟着几位主播的节奏，一起来推出事件的真相吧。别忘了查看Shownotes中的图片补充哦。</span></p><p><span>欢迎微信搜索“</span><strong><span>tianjinrere2024</span></strong><span>”加入听友群，各大平台搜索“天津惹惹广播”订阅我们的播客。让我们和更多内容一起惹惹！</span></p><p><span>—</span></p><p><span>// 惹惹时间轴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">00:02:10</a>&nbsp; 开篇：你们有没有网购过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">00:04:50</a>&nbsp; 委托的起因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">00:09:32</a>&nbsp; 奇怪的快读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">00:14:52</a>&nbsp; 线索：假地址</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">00:22:20</a>&nbsp; 中场分析</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1667">00:27:47</a>&nbsp; 解析</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2377">00:39:37</a>&nbsp; 选择更远的邮便局</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2472">00:41:12</a>&nbsp; 寄给房间的快递</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">00:44:55</a>&nbsp; 房子的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3005">00:50:05</a>&nbsp; 入住一览</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">00:50:45</a>&nbsp; 中场分析2</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3301">00:55:01</a>&nbsp; 电话调查</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3813">01:03:33</a>&nbsp; 网络检索而来的新线索</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4371">01:12:51</a>&nbsp; 9月13的包裹</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4431">01:13:51</a>&nbsp; 自白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4514">01:15:14</a>&nbsp; 21年10月</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4793">01:19:53</a>&nbsp; 另一个箱子，另一个故事</span></p><p><span><a class="t